1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 21]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:01:58,230 --> 00:01:59,790
Mr. Zhang, how have you been?

4
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:03,130
I never expected to meet you here

5
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:05,620
after all these years.

6
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,570
You still remember me?

7
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:16,130
What you did in Changsha

8
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:18,130
is still fresh in my mind.

9
00:02:19,270 --> 00:02:20,380
How could I forget you?

10
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:23,980
Times have changed.

11
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,980
You and Mr. Yin are family now,

12
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,410
and I'm also here

13
00:02:29,430 --> 00:02:30,380
to do business with him.

14
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,410
I'd call that fate.

15
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:34,660
Mr. Zhang,

16
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,170
why not be friends with me?

17
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:39,170
Given your situation now, it'd serve you well.

18
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,130
Friends value loyalty.

19
00:02:42,710 --> 00:02:43,660
Merchants value profit.

20
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,890
You're a merchant, Mr. Hendry.

21
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,060
Since you helped me,

22
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:51,060
you must be here

23
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,130
to talk business, aren't you?

24
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:55,730
Business and friendship

25
00:02:55,750 --> 00:02:56,610
need not conflict.

26
00:02:57,710 --> 00:02:58,170
Look,

27
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:00,010
we Americans in China

28
00:03:00,030 --> 00:03:02,060
have built universities, hospitals, and newspapers.

29
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:03,940
That shows our willingness

30
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,060
to befriend China.

31
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:07,500
China needs friends,

32
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,730
not masters.

33
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,290
We only want

34
00:03:11,310 --> 00:03:12,450
mutually beneficial cooperation.

35
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:16,220
I'm in the antique trade.

36
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:17,820
I've set my sights

37
00:03:17,870 --> 00:03:19,660
on the ancient Chu tombs between Xiangtan and Yueyang.

38
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:22,780
I want exclusive control of that trade route.

39
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,940
If the treasures can leave China smoothly,

40
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,410
Chinese antiquities can

41
00:03:27,430 --> 00:03:28,340
gain renown overseas

42
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,780
while bringing back hard cash.

43
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:32,730
Everyone benefits.

44
00:03:35,310 --> 00:03:36,340
Times have changed.

45
00:03:36,910 --> 00:03:38,780
You need to change with them.

46
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,540
Those who stand still will be left behind.

47
00:03:44,190 --> 00:03:46,060
I won't do business selling off

48
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,130
our ancestors' legacy.

49
00:03:50,710 --> 00:03:51,690
Only by holding on to our roots

50
00:03:53,470 --> 00:03:56,730
can Chinese people remain Chinese.

51
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,500
No one can change that.

52
00:04:00,910 --> 00:04:01,660
Besides,

53
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,850
our descendants

54
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:05,010
will be watching us.

55
00:04:06,310 --> 00:04:07,290
No Chinese person

56
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:10,170
would do such a thing.

57
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:13,100
Perhaps it's simply too difficult

58
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:14,690
for you to understand.

59
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,020
What our roots mean to us

60
00:04:20,690 --> 00:04:21,980
is something you could never understand.

61
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,700
Take me to the train station.

62
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:34,700
Sir,

63
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,340
we've confirmed

64
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,100
that man's identity.

65
00:04:37,750 --> 00:04:39,170
He's the Changsha Defense Commander,

66
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,580
Zhang Qishan.

67
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:42,220
Zhang Qishan?

68
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:48,380
[Zhang Qishan]

69
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,580
He infiltrated the Beiping auction

70
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,140
with a false identity?

71
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:56,290
He abandoned his post

72
00:04:56,430 --> 00:04:57,290
and overstepped his authority.

73
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:58,700
He should face military justice!

74
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,930
Notify Nanjing immediately

75
00:05:03,430 --> 00:05:05,140
and demand an explanation from them!

76
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:05,700
Yes!

77
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:17,250
Sir,

78
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,100
the Beiping Office

79
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,490
of the Japanese Foreign Affairs Ministry called.

80
00:05:22,830 --> 00:05:24,370
Torii Tottori has accused Zhang Qishan

81
00:05:25,190 --> 00:05:26,960
of assuming a false identity,

82
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,390
deliberately provoking a diplomatic incident,

83
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:29,700
and violating the Sino-Japanese agreement.

84
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:31,850
He demands that Nanjing be notified at once

85
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:33,140
and Zhang be severely punished.

86
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:34,610
Otherwise,

87
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,250
he will report it to the Japanese Foreign Affairs Ministry in Tokyo

88
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:40,730
as a hostile act

89
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:41,610
at the government level.

90
00:05:48,830 --> 00:05:49,610
This matter

91
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,170
may still take a different turn.

92
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:53,100
Don't report it yet.

93
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:54,610
Understood.

94
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:12,660
Why are you helping me?

95
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,100
To avoid trouble.

96
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,780
If Tottori catches you,

97
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:19,250
an already troublesome situation

98
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,700
will become even worse.

99
00:06:21,870 --> 00:06:23,020
Have you thought about it?

100
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,730
Even if you had gotten the medicine,

101
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,220
would that have ended things?

102
00:06:32,630 --> 00:06:34,370
Knowing Torii Tottori,

103
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,810
I'm sure he wouldn't let me off.

104
00:06:37,950 --> 00:06:39,020
I was too impatient.

105
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,410
But perhaps this is for the best.

106
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:47,370
Since I don't have long to live,

107
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:50,050
he won't keep targeting the Huo Clan.

108
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:53,340
Why give up so quickly?

109
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:59,660
This is called mold filtrate.

110
00:06:59,750 --> 00:07:00,660
It was developed

111
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,490
by the British.

112
00:07:01,630 --> 00:07:03,170
I hear it's still at the experimental stage.

113
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,200
If you're brave enough,

114
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,900
you can test it for them.

115
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:13,420
[MOULD FILTRATE]

116
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,540
Why exactly are you helping me?

117
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,020
Once I die,

118
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:23,580
won't it be easier

119
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,100
to settle things

120
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,050
peacefully?

121
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,490
If a problem

122
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:30,610
can only be solved by a young woman's death,

123
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:32,610
Xinyue Restaurant

124
00:07:32,630 --> 00:07:34,100
might as well close its doors.

125
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,540
You're a businessman.

126
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,460
You care only about results.

127
00:07:42,310 --> 00:07:43,020
That's right.

128
00:07:44,070 --> 00:07:45,170
But you're one of the very few

129
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,220
I've met

130
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,580
who still look to the road ahead

131
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,220
knowing they have little time left.

132
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,410
You know,

133
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:55,340
most people in this world

134
00:07:55,430 --> 00:07:56,810
are searching for a way to survive.

135
00:07:57,750 --> 00:07:59,730
Very few know what they're

136
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,490
living for.

137
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,730
The world to come

138
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,660
needs people like you.

139
00:08:46,030 --> 00:08:46,610
Master Zhang,

140
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,060
why haven't Heibei and Chen Pi

141
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:51,530
shown up yet?

142
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,940
Could something have happened?

143
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:03,530
Heibei!

144
00:09:04,910 --> 00:09:05,460
Heibei,

145
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:06,820
are you all right?

146
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:09,770
Food's hard to come by here.

147
00:09:10,270 --> 00:09:11,530
I'd rather go back to Changsha.

148
00:09:15,030 --> 00:09:15,770
Where's Chen Pi?

149
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:24,460
Chen Pi!

150
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,220
Tiezui!

151
00:10:21,270 --> 00:10:21,820
Master Zhang.

152
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:23,490
Doesn't he look like...?

153
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:28,770
A little.

154
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,580
Could he be...?

155
00:10:33,910 --> 00:10:34,580
It's possible.

156
00:10:44,030 --> 00:10:44,890
His breathing is weak.

157
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,060
His face is shriveled and gaunt.

158
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:50,250
There must be some toxin in his body.

159
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,650
Since he's dressed in a Daoist robe,

160
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,420
at first glance,

161
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,180
he could be mistaken for an ascended mummy.

162
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:00,130
What a risky move.

163
00:11:00,750 --> 00:11:02,940
Laogou disguised himself as an ascended mummy

164
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,130
so Xinyue Restaurant could fish him out

165
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,130
and send him to Beiping for auction.

166
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:08,610
But what if Xinyue Restaurant

167
00:11:08,630 --> 00:11:09,730
hadn't found him?

168
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:13,730
The current would've carried him into the Jinsha River

169
00:11:14,390 --> 00:11:15,220
for a water burial.

170
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,060
I suppose

171
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,010
he anticipated that.

172
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:20,940
He had no choice but to risk his life.

173
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:21,940
He was gambling

174
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,850
on being pulled from the water

175
00:11:24,270 --> 00:11:26,700
and on us finding him.

176
00:11:28,630 --> 00:11:29,940
The risk was enormous.

177
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,460
Either Laogou had no other way to survive

178
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:33,490
and risked everything,

179
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:35,420
or

180
00:11:36,630 --> 00:11:37,460
he had a compelling reason

181
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,580
to get out of there.

182
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:40,530
But Laogou

183
00:11:40,550 --> 00:11:41,650
is a clever man.

184
00:11:42,150 --> 00:11:43,610
Before he lost consciousness,

185
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:44,980
he must have

186
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:47,060
left us some kind of clue

187
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:49,130
or hint.

188
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:51,060
You're right.

189
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:52,770
Adjutant.

190
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:53,580
Tweezers.

191
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:22,650
This was drawn by Laogou.

192
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:26,460
It...

193
00:12:26,910 --> 00:12:28,100
It's a clock face.

194
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:31,250
I see.

195
00:12:31,750 --> 00:12:32,980
What Laogou is trying to tell us

196
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,100
has something to do with time.

197
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:35,530
But

198
00:12:36,750 --> 00:12:38,180
what exactly is he trying to tell us?

199
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,220
The Japanese captured Laogou,

200
00:12:43,510 --> 00:12:44,530
and he risked his life to escape.

201
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,980
They've probably already made their move.

202
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:50,460
Perhaps he's telling us

203
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:52,890
we're running out of time.

204
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,180
What's this, Master Zhang?

205
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:13,650
I know. This thing...

206
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:14,700
Master Zhang.

207
00:13:15,150 --> 00:13:15,610
Master Zhang,

208
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:16,300
what...?

209
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:17,890
Why did you make him swallow it?

210
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,940
What if something goes wrong?

211
00:13:20,870 --> 00:13:21,420
What?

212
00:13:22,790 --> 00:13:23,730
If it's not for him,

213
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,700
then who?

214
00:13:30,870 --> 00:13:32,940
He must've been in that chest for days.

215
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,490
An ordinary person would've died already.

216
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:36,530
We need a doctor.

217
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:38,820
Laogou must've used

218
00:13:38,870 --> 00:13:39,610
some special method.

219
00:13:40,750 --> 00:13:42,060
A doctor probably won't help.

220
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:45,370
He's this weak now

221
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,100
because we never realized

222
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,220
he was inside.

223
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,940
We were far too complacent.

224
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:53,370
We may get him killed this time.

225
00:13:53,990 --> 00:13:55,780
Turtle Breathing requires a stable environment.

226
00:13:56,150 --> 00:13:57,460
I do know a few ways

227
00:13:57,750 --> 00:13:58,570
to revive and stabilize him.

228
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:00,260
He just took the pill.

229
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:01,940
If it's effective,

230
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,420
Laogou should

231
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:04,530
already be recovering.

232
00:14:04,670 --> 00:14:05,260
I don't believe it.

233
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,130
I can't help but worry.

234
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,260
You carry a baleful aura.

235
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:10,970
Stay back.

236
00:14:11,310 --> 00:14:12,420
I can definitely save him.

237
00:14:16,630 --> 00:14:17,920
I know every remedy in the book

238
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:19,340
and specialize in difficult ailments.

239
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:22,100
Powdered star anise mixed with strong liquor

240
00:14:22,870 --> 00:14:24,130
will boost the pill's efficacy.

241
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:32,850
Dress the wounds properly.

242
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:33,980
Don't let them get infected.

243
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:34,730
Yes.

244
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,580
Laogou still hasn't woken up?

245
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:56,060
Something was already

246
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,730
very wrong with you at the auction.

247
00:14:59,790 --> 00:15:00,980
What really happened?

248
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,180
It's been many years.

249
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,180
Indeed.

250
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:08,460
Now,

251
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:11,340
I suppose I should call you Officer Luo.

252
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:16,730
What official business brings you here today?

253
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,340
The Japanese have been

254
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:21,060
collecting our antiques and paintings everywhere.

255
00:15:21,550 --> 00:15:22,370
The Central Government

256
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,250
has just established

257
00:15:23,270 --> 00:15:24,600
a Cultural Heritage Preservation Committee.

258
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,980
I'm here to find out what's really going on.

259
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:28,610
We can't

260
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:30,300
let everything our ancestors left us

261
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:31,890
fall into foreign hands.

262
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:41,300
Chen Minzhi?

263
00:15:44,440 --> 00:15:45,250
Now that's strange.

264
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,700
Do you dislike your old name?

265
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:54,010
Relax.

266
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:56,540
I know you came

267
00:15:56,540 --> 00:15:57,220
with Zhang.

268
00:15:58,200 --> 00:15:59,340
He had little choice himself.

269
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:00,980
Circumstances forced his hand.

270
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,890
Official business was only

271
00:16:03,510 --> 00:16:04,700
part of why I came to Beiping.

272
00:16:05,910 --> 00:16:07,420
What I really wanted was to see an old friend.

273
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:18,370
You found time to catch up despite your duties.

274
00:16:19,390 --> 00:16:21,300
There must be something important to discuss.

275
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:23,130
The Central Government is drafting

276
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:24,940
regulations to purge local armed groups.

277
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:25,820
Any organization not incorporated

278
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:26,890
into the central military system

279
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:28,100
will be disbanded,

280
00:16:28,270 --> 00:16:29,850
disarmed, and outlawed.

281
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,130
The Mystic Nine

282
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,100
is among them.

283
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:37,940
Back when we were classmates,

284
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:40,580
you often lamented that even without foreign threats, the country

285
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,460
still had troubles within.

286
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,580
Now you hold high office.

287
00:16:43,910 --> 00:16:45,460
Once that regulation takes effect,

288
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,490
it will carry far more weight

289
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,100
than those words ever did.

290
00:16:50,030 --> 00:16:51,460
I have little choice.

291
00:16:53,790 --> 00:16:54,890
How far

292
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:56,890
will the outlawing go?

293
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,580
With foreign enemies watching closely,

294
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,370
we cannot tolerate any private armed force

295
00:17:01,390 --> 00:17:02,300
getting in the way in the rear.

296
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:03,850
If the country is unstable within,

297
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,460
turmoil will follow without.

298
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,220
Groups like the Mystic Nine

299
00:17:07,350 --> 00:17:08,570
will inevitably be the first targets.

300
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,180
None can be allowed to remain.

301
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:13,810
But the Mystic Nine have done much

302
00:17:13,830 --> 00:17:14,900
to keep the region stable.

303
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,090
If they're all wiped out,

304
00:17:17,590 --> 00:17:19,490
it could endanger the situation,

305
00:17:20,110 --> 00:17:22,050
and their followers across the region won't stay quiet.

306
00:17:23,070 --> 00:17:24,700
That's why I came to see you.

307
00:17:26,110 --> 00:17:26,980
I know

308
00:17:28,310 --> 00:17:30,050
not everyone in the Mystic Nine is wicked.

309
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:32,380
I respect Zhang Qishan's loyalty and courage,

310
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,220
and your strong sense of principle.

311
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:36,010
If Changsha

312
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:38,180
loses this vital force one day,

313
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:40,660
I'll grieve too.

314
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,570
How much time do we have?

315
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:44,660
The order will reach the provinces soon.

316
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:46,090
No more than a month.

317
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:49,250
If I help you delay any longer, it'll be favoritism.

318
00:17:49,830 --> 00:17:50,490
Mr. Xie,

319
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:52,220
you're a businessman.

320
00:17:52,550 --> 00:17:54,050
No one reads the situation better than you.

321
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,900
If the Mystic Nine can't be saved,

322
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:01,730
please don't let Changsha erupt in violence overnight.

323
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:16,050
One month.

324
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:19,010
Enough time to prepare my coffin.

325
00:18:19,550 --> 00:18:20,050
Mr. Luo,

326
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:22,530
I won't forget what you told me today.

327
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,250
I'll give you

328
00:18:24,270 --> 00:18:25,330
a satisfactory answer.

329
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,660
May this drink

330
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,810
not be our last.

331
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,290
It's just my craving acting up.

332
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:40,620
Once we're back in Changsha,

333
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,620
I'll need to recuperate properly.

334
00:18:54,350 --> 00:18:55,250
After we return,

335
00:18:55,830 --> 00:18:57,380
I'll need you to come to my residence.

336
00:18:58,350 --> 00:19:00,010
As for the false accusation that you colluded with the enemy,

337
00:19:00,270 --> 00:19:01,860
I'll need some time to clear it up.

338
00:19:02,510 --> 00:19:03,490
Someone's handling it.

339
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,620
At Xinyue Restaurant,

340
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:11,260
I ran into an old friend,

341
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:12,730
a senior official in the Ministry of War.

342
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,940
He said he'd take care of it.

343
00:19:15,590 --> 00:19:16,570
Once we're back in Changsha,

344
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,530
I'll be cleared of all charges.

345
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:21,180
Which official?

346
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,180
Do I know him?

347
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,290
A friend from my school days.

348
00:19:26,110 --> 00:19:26,860
You don't know him.

349
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,290
I didn't expect

350
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:42,730
Cox Hendry to show up too.

351
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,250
He was after the artifact chests too, wasn't he?

352
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:47,620
What did he say to you?

353
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,140
On the surface, he wanted

354
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,900
to work with me to smuggle antiquities,

355
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:54,980
but in truth,

356
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,660
he has designs on Changsha.

357
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:01,770
Changsha is a strategic gateway

358
00:20:02,070 --> 00:20:03,140
to the south and west.

359
00:20:04,270 --> 00:20:05,490
If war breaks out,

360
00:20:06,510 --> 00:20:08,900
it will certainly become fiercely contested.

361
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:12,900
Perhaps he sees me as someone who moves

362
00:20:13,310 --> 00:20:15,180
between civilian and military circles,

363
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,140
someone easy to use

364
00:20:17,510 --> 00:20:18,660
to help him control Changsha.

365
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:21,250
We haven't even dealt with the Japanese,

366
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:22,730
and now the Americans are here too.

367
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,530
We'll deal with whatever comes.

368
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:28,090
Master Zhang,

369
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,250
if Laogou truly can't wake up,

370
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:31,810
what will you do?

371
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,380
He will wake up.

372
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:36,660
The Japanese back at Xinyue Restaurant

373
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:38,180
were after that artifact chest.

374
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,460
Japanese forces are everywhere now.

375
00:20:42,830 --> 00:20:44,460
The situation could change at any moment.

376
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:46,660
If we want to find out quickly

377
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:47,530
what the Japanese are planning,

378
00:20:48,270 --> 00:20:49,420
Laogou is our only lead.

379
00:20:52,030 --> 00:20:53,220
Why are the Japanese

380
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:54,330
so fixated on Laogou?

381
00:20:55,270 --> 00:20:57,090
What secret does he hold?

382
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:01,140
Master Zhang.

383
00:21:02,110 --> 00:21:02,770
Fifth Master is awake.

384
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:04,330
Master Zhang,

385
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:06,140
he seems to have lost his memory.

386
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:19,530
Laogou.

387
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:25,330
Laogou,

388
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:27,700
what happened?

389
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:42,250
What exactly happened?

390
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:49,050
Do you know who you are?

391
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:53,810
Then do you know

392
00:21:53,830 --> 00:21:55,250
who wreaked havoc in Heaven?

393
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:57,250
The Great Sage Equaling Heaven,

394
00:21:58,310 --> 00:21:59,140
Sun Wukong.

395
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:10,090
Who are you?

396
00:22:11,750 --> 00:22:12,700
And who am I?

397
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:20,700
Your name is Wu Laogou.

398
00:22:22,790 --> 00:22:23,980
I'm Zhang Qishan.

399
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:29,810
I'm taking you home.

400
00:22:37,860 --> 00:22:41,310
[Exit]

401
00:22:41,310 --> 00:22:42,290
Laogou went to such lengths

402
00:22:42,310 --> 00:22:43,330
to get that note out.

403
00:22:44,070 --> 00:22:44,940
It may hold the truth

404
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:45,940
about the Otherworld Tower.

405
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:47,720
He must have known

406
00:22:47,750 --> 00:22:49,000
Turtle Breathing would erase his memory,

407
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:50,880
so he hid the clues in the note.

408
00:22:52,350 --> 00:22:53,900
But none of us can decipher it.

409
00:22:56,270 --> 00:22:57,250
Let's ask the Wu Clan.

410
00:23:01,100 --> 00:23:08,980
[Changsha]

411
00:23:11,220 --> 00:23:13,220
[Wu's Residence]

412
00:23:24,590 --> 00:23:25,570
This is my home?

413
00:23:38,720 --> 00:23:39,530
Wow.

414
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,180
It's lively here.

415
00:23:41,830 --> 00:23:42,810
Do I raise dogs for a living?

416
00:23:43,790 --> 00:23:45,460
That's only one of your businesses.

417
00:23:46,110 --> 00:23:46,810
More importantly,

418
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:49,180
you're the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

419
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:51,900
The Mystic Nine?

420
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:55,330
Sounds like some gang of hoodlums.

421
00:23:56,550 --> 00:23:58,660
Just look at me. I'm clearly a decent man.

422
00:23:58,960 --> 00:24:00,380
I'd never be in that line of work.

423
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:03,380
Little bird.

424
00:24:04,270 --> 00:24:04,810
Come here.

425
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:06,090
Come here.

426
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:07,380
Fifth Master?

427
00:24:09,030 --> 00:24:09,530
Master!

428
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,220
Master is back!

429
00:24:12,790 --> 00:24:13,770
Master is back!

430
00:24:14,720 --> 00:24:15,330
He's back?

431
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:16,180
Master!

432
00:24:16,310 --> 00:24:17,290
- Master! - Master!

433
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:17,980
Where is he?

434
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:18,770
- Master! - Master!

435
00:24:19,790 --> 00:24:20,620
- Master! - Master!

436
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:22,420
- Master! - Master!

437
00:24:22,550 --> 00:24:23,460
You're back!

438
00:24:23,750 --> 00:24:24,420
It really is you!

439
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:25,460
Where have you been all this time?

440
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:26,380
We were worried sick.

441
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:27,900
I knew you were still alive.

442
00:24:28,030 --> 00:24:28,620
Where did you go?

443
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:29,700
We missed you so much!

444
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:31,460
- That's right, Master!
- We really missed you!

445
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:32,380
Master?

446
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:36,770
Who...

447
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:38,900
Who are you?

448
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,490
We work for you, Master.

449
00:24:40,510 --> 00:24:40,920
Yeah.

450
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:42,180
Master, stop messing with us.

451
00:24:43,200 --> 00:24:43,940
You work for me?

452
00:24:47,070 --> 00:24:48,490
So I really am the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine?

453
00:24:55,310 --> 00:24:55,730
Master Zhang,

454
00:24:56,790 --> 00:24:57,730
what's wrong with Fifth Master?

455
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:58,770
Doesn't he recognize us?

456
00:25:00,310 --> 00:25:01,010
He's lost his memory.

457
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:03,490
Lost his memory?

458
00:25:03,740 --> 00:25:04,620
Master.

459
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:05,860
Are you hurt? Where?

460
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:06,770
Don't grab at me.

461
00:25:06,770 --> 00:25:07,380
Let me see.

462
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:08,050
Put the knife down.

463
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:08,940
Put it down.

464
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:19,620
Remember anything?

465
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:21,980
Listen.

466
00:25:23,510 --> 00:25:24,490
Take good care of him.

467
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,250
If he remembers anything,

468
00:25:26,550 --> 00:25:27,250
tell me at once.

469
00:25:29,070 --> 00:25:29,530
Wait.

470
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:33,380
These bandits

471
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:36,900
don't look like decent people.

472
00:25:38,350 --> 00:25:39,420
You're an official, aren't you?

473
00:25:39,790 --> 00:25:40,660
Your place must be comfortable.

474
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:41,620
I'll stay with you.

475
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:43,810
- Master! - Master!

476
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:44,530
Master!

477
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,940
Master, where are you going?

478
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:47,660
This is your home!

479
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:48,290
Yeah!

480
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:00,900
You never used to come

481
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:03,010
to my residence.

482
00:26:03,790 --> 00:26:05,010
Why wouldn't I come

483
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:06,700
to a place this nice?

484
00:26:08,350 --> 00:26:09,380
It's full of soldiers.

485
00:26:09,960 --> 00:26:11,140
Maybe you never felt safe here.

486
00:26:14,550 --> 00:26:15,660
You're hiding something from me.

487
00:26:18,960 --> 00:26:19,530
Never mind.

488
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:21,330
Give me time,

489
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:22,530
and I'll figure it out.

490
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:25,380
You'll stay here from now on.

491
00:26:26,960 --> 00:26:27,420
Master Zhang.

492
00:26:28,680 --> 00:26:29,290
Everything

493
00:26:29,590 --> 00:26:30,660
Fifth Master needs has been

494
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:31,380
prepared to his liking.

495
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:32,290
Good.

496
00:26:33,350 --> 00:26:34,460
To my liking?

497
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,810
Did we know each other well?

498
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:55,900
Get some rest.

499
00:26:56,830 --> 00:26:57,860
If you remember anything,

500
00:26:58,270 --> 00:26:59,050
tell me anytime.

501
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,460
Tomorrow, I'll look for doctors

502
00:27:01,750 --> 00:27:02,900
and see if anyone can treat you.

503
00:27:09,830 --> 00:27:10,290
Master Zhang,

504
00:27:11,550 --> 00:27:12,330
the Wu Clan said

505
00:27:13,030 --> 00:27:14,330
they'd never seen the symbols

506
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:15,420
on that note before,

507
00:27:16,110 --> 00:27:16,900
so they couldn't decipher them.

508
00:27:17,070 --> 00:27:18,700
We may have to wait until Fifth Master recovers

509
00:27:18,750 --> 00:27:19,490
before we can decipher it.

510
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:22,420
He expected he might die,

511
00:27:23,110 --> 00:27:24,330
so he must have believed

512
00:27:24,440 --> 00:27:25,530
someone could decipher the note.

513
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,620
Who?

514
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:28,290
Xiangu.

515
00:27:29,270 --> 00:27:30,660
This note was meant for her.

516
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:32,860
She should be able to decipher it.

517
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:35,140
Then I'll ask Miss Huo to come.

518
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:36,860
Take the note to her.

519
00:27:37,720 --> 00:27:38,220
Yes.

520
00:28:15,790 --> 00:28:16,250
Fifth Master.

521
00:28:17,590 --> 00:28:18,940
I couldn't sleep, so I came out for a walk.

522
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:20,490
I'm not going to get shot, am I?

523
00:28:21,550 --> 00:28:22,570
Just don't disturb Master Zhang.

524
00:28:57,550 --> 00:28:58,530
Master Zhang

525
00:28:58,590 --> 00:28:59,530
doesn't trust me, does he?

526
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:00,700
I don't trust you.

527
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:02,290
But I don't speak for Master Zhang.

528
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:05,420
What kind of person

529
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:06,420
was I before?

530
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:08,490
Either remember it yourself,

531
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:10,420
or let Master Zhang tell you.

532
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:11,730
You're that loyal to him?

533
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:14,940
You should be called Puppy Zhang instead.

534
00:29:24,790 --> 00:29:25,250
Master Zhang.

535
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,220
Miss Huo is here to see you.

536
00:29:46,240 --> 00:29:46,700
Master Zhang,

537
00:29:47,440 --> 00:29:48,860
I heard you brought Laogou back.

538
00:29:49,680 --> 00:29:50,330
I've come to see him.

539
00:29:50,640 --> 00:29:52,010
Did you decipher the note?

540
00:29:52,550 --> 00:29:53,460
What exactly does it say?

541
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:55,220
Is it related to the Otherworld Tower?

542
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:57,530
I only understood part of it.

543
00:29:59,400 --> 00:30:00,460
I'd like to see him first.

544
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:04,180
All right. Come with me.

545
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:08,140
But prepare yourself.

546
00:30:35,270 --> 00:30:35,810
Laogou.

547
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:56,860
Don't you remember me?

548
00:30:59,030 --> 00:30:59,770
Who are you?

549
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:03,010
I'm Xiangu.

550
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:07,660
You're one of the Mystic Nine too?

551
00:31:09,510 --> 00:31:10,330
I've lost my memory.

552
00:31:10,500 --> 00:31:15,580
♪Your beauty resembles a pristine portrait♪

553
00:31:16,020 --> 00:31:21,140
♪When will the white horse return? I keep thinking about you♪

554
00:31:21,580 --> 00:31:27,020
♪I ask the water of Yique, who has moved into my heart?♪

555
00:31:27,460 --> 00:31:33,340
♪Pinching time with my fingertips, my longing for you keeps me awake...♪

556
00:31:38,030 --> 00:31:39,050
You really don't remember?

557
00:31:39,740 --> 00:31:44,940
♪The story continues for millennia, and your beauty remains...♪

558
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:46,620
Miss, please show some restraint.

559
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:50,010
You're not pretending, are you?

560
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:51,220
Pretending?

561
00:31:58,640 --> 00:31:59,980
Were you really that important to me?

562
00:32:01,220 --> 00:32:06,300
♪Don't let your misguided devotion squander away your youth...♪

563
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:07,810
Why don't I remember you at all?

564
00:32:12,700 --> 00:32:18,500
♪I wish my heart would keep shining as it did when we first met...♪

565
00:32:20,110 --> 00:32:20,700
Perhaps

566
00:32:25,550 --> 00:32:26,700
this is fate.

567
00:32:30,500 --> 00:32:35,700
♪Why fear the storms and all their changes?♪

568
00:32:36,420 --> 00:32:46,580
♪I wish my heart would keep shining as it did when we first met♪

569
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:54,770
Master Zhang.

570
00:33:01,550 --> 00:33:02,900
What exactly happened to him?

571
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:09,380
I found him inside an artifact chest.

572
00:33:11,030 --> 00:33:13,380
He was lying there disguised as an ascended mummy.

573
00:33:15,960 --> 00:33:17,620
The only thing we know for certain

574
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:20,380
is that after he vanished from the Otherworld Tower,

575
00:33:21,110 --> 00:33:22,660
something very important happened,

576
00:33:23,880 --> 00:33:24,730
and it

577
00:33:24,750 --> 00:33:26,140
was connected to Unit 401.

578
00:33:27,160 --> 00:33:27,770
What about you?

579
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:29,860
After seeing him,

580
00:33:29,880 --> 00:33:31,140
